    correctAnswer: 0,
    explanationEn: "ARR = control event rate (CER) - experimental event rate (EER) = 10% - 5% = 5%. RRR = ARR/CER = 5%/10% = 50%. NNT = 1/ARR = 1/0.05 = 20 (need to treat 20 patients to prevent 1 death). RRR alone can be misleading; always report ARR and NNT.",
    explanationZh: "ARR = CER - EER = 10% - 5% = 5%。RRR = ARR/CER = 50%。NNT = 1/ARR = 20（需治疗20例以预防1例死亡）。仅报告RRR可能误导；总应报告ARR和NNT。",
